[0m22:21:14.820636 [debug] [Thread-3 (]: Re-using an available connection from the pool (formerly test.gn_dw_silver.unique_FACT_EVENT_ATTENDANCE_EVENT_BK_MEMBER_DK_PARTCPT_SEQ.39535470a6, now test.gn_dw_silver.accepted_values_FACT_MEMBER_EVENT_AGE_BAND_AT_EVENT__True__10___10___20___30___40___50___60___70___70__________.cc1b3859a0)
