      DEV_MEMBERS COMMENT $$개발(명) COUNT (#148)$$,
      STOP_CNT COMMENT $$중단(건) (#35, FME 롤업)$$,
      UNPAID_CNT COMMENT $$미납(건) (#36)$$,
      ACTIVE_CNT COMMENT $$활동(건) (#37·157)$$,
      ACTIVE_MEMBERS COMMENT $$활동(명) (#156)$$,
      ACTIVE_CUM_CNT COMMENT $$활동누계(건) (#159)$$,
