      CAL_MONTH COMMENT $$MOD(MONTH_KEY,100) — 월$$,
      MEMBER_DK COMMENT $$불변 회원키(조인용)$$,
      DEV_CNT COMMENT $$개발(건) SUM(금액)/10000 (#4·5·149)$$,
      DEV_MEMBERS COMMENT $$개발(명) COUNT (#148)$$,
      STOP_CNT COMMENT $$중단(건) (#35, FME 롤업)$$,
