      INCREASE_CNT COMMENT $$증액(건) (#151)$$,
      INCREASE_MEMBERS COMMENT $$증액(명) (#150)$$,
      DECREASE_CNT COMMENT $$감액(건) SUM(감액금액)/10000 (#38)$$,
      CHURN_CNT COMMENT $$이탈(건) SUM(취소+감액)/10000 (신규#20)$$,
